              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezekieli 2:9–10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.29.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 29:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu nátsupha matso mkpwono wa kulume wa yuya asegereye chihi cha chifalume, na nchiona chitabu. Nacho kala chikaandikpwa kosi-kosi, tsona kala chikafungbwa na ukaka mwatu sabaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nchiona malaika wa nguvu sana anagomba na hoyo, kuuza, “Ni ani ambaye anafwaha kugandula ukaka hinyu na kuvugula chitabu hichi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela takuna mutu hiko mlunguni, duniani, wala kuzimu yekala anafwaha kuchivugula na kuchisoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nárira sana kpwa sababu takuyaphahikana yeyesi ambaye anafwaha kuchivugula wala kuchisoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
