            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.11.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho mmwenga wa hara atumia achiniamba, “Usirire! Hebu lola! Simba wa Mbari ya Juda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chitabu cha Mwandzo 49:9 mbari ya Juda inaihwa simba, na Mfalume Daudi ala Juda.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na ambaye ni chivyazi chikulu cha Mfalume Daudi, washinda. Kpwa hivyo anaweza kugandula ukaka mwatu sabaa mwa hicho chitabu na kuchifwenula.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 53:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zakariya 4:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu hipho kahi-kahi phokala na chihi cha chifalume, náona Mwana ngʼondzi aimire. Naye kala akazungulukpwa ni viumbe vine na hara atumia mirongo miiri na ane. Kala uchimuona hiye Mwana ngʼondzi avi akaolagbwa. Kala ana pembe sabaa na matso sabaa, na higo matso kala ni zira roho sabaa za Mlungu zokala zikahumwa chila phatu dunia ndzima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi yuya Mwana ngʼondzi wakpwendahala chira chitabu kula mkpwono wa kulume wa yuya yekala asegere chihi cha chifalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.141.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 141:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphohala chira chitabu, vira viumbe na hara atumia amgbwerera maguluni. Nao chila mmwenga kala ana ngephephe na ndzele ya zahabu tele ubani, ambao kala ni mavoyo ga atu a Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
